  vendorName: Smuggler Silas
  offerText: I have a rare, caged parrot from the tropics. It requires a large corner
    and a hefty fee, but its beautiful singing will bring life to this dreary room.
  acceptResultText: The massive birdcage takes up your entire living room. The parrot
    sings a beautiful melody.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to engage in illegal smuggling. Feeling incredibly
    righteous, you clean your old coat and find a crisp bill in the pocket!
  acceptedDelayedText: The parrot goes feral. It screeches deafeningly and bites
    your finger to the bone.
